Back-office UI for NGOs to:
  1. Accept donations via Stripe, Square, Authorize.net
  2. Auto-purchase XMR via Onramper or Kraken from collected funds

5 frames:
  1. Dashboard         -- totals, processor health, recent activity
  2. Payment Processors-- connect/configure Stripe, Square, Authorize.net
  3. Auto-Convert      -- Onramper/Kraken config, threshold, XMR address
  4. Donations Feed    -- incoming donations, conversion status per row
  5. XMR Treasury      -- XMR balance, acquisition log, export
"""
